OL,3,GNEWSASecond arrest after fire destroys
OL,4,AGatwick passengers' cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome customers who have returned to
OL,7,Ftheir cars say their vehicles have been
OL,8,F"burnt to a shell" as a result of the
OL,9,Ffire. Sapphire Parking was approached
OL,10,Ffor comment.
